WEBVTT

00:04.070 --> 00:05.650
Draw your blades.

00:06.780 --> 00:10.770
If we see it, it'll only be for a second.

00:17.620 --> 00:18.790
Go!

00:32.720 --> 00:33.600
It's fast!

00:33.601 --> 00:36.589
In these trees, there's no way to
foresee and evade its attacks!

00:36.590 --> 00:37.640
It'll catch us!

00:37.900 --> 00:39.810
Captain, let's switch to Maneuver Gear!

00:40.400 --> 00:41.690
Captain!

00:43.670 --> 00:45.190
You won't escape!

00:45.690 --> 00:47.120
Reinforcements from the rear!

01:02.940 --> 01:04.919
Captain, your orders?!

01:04.920 --> 01:06.089
Let's go for it!

01:06.090 --> 01:07.589
It's dangerous...

01:07.590 --> 01:09.289
We should kill it!

01:09.290 --> 01:11.079
At this rate, it will catch up with us!

01:11.080 --> 01:12.220
We kill it here...

01:12.570 --> 01:14.499
That's why we came to this forest!

01:14.500 --> 01:16.479
Right, Captain?

01:16.480 --> 01:18.590
Captain, your orders!

01:21.590 --> 01:23.800
Everyone, cover your ears.

03:07.173 --> 03:10.637
Sync and corrections by masaca
- addic7ed.com -

03:12.300 --> 03:17.300
Bite
57 th Expedition Beyond the Walls (3)

03:25.560 --> 03:26.810
A noise grenade?

03:27.810 --> 03:29.460
What is your job?

03:29.850 --> 03:32.820
To just let yourself be swayed by whatever
you're feeling at the moment?

03:33.220 --> 03:35.000
No, it's not.

03:35.480 --> 03:36.820
Our squad's job

03:37.220 --> 03:40.960
is to keep the brat from getting
a single scratch on him.

03:41.910 --> 03:43.330
Even if it costs our lives.

03:47.260 --> 03:49.460
It wasn't to keep watch on me?

03:49.640 --> 03:53.130
We keep going on our horses, got it?

03:53.340 --> 03:54.440
Roger!

03:55.590 --> 03:58.470
Keep going? For how long?

03:58.860 --> 04:01.700
And it's right on top of us...

04:03.370 --> 04:04.480
Again!

04:05.190 --> 04:06.269
The reinforcements!

04:06.270 --> 04:08.730
If we don't help, they'll
be wiped out again!

04:08.900 --> 04:10.570
Eren, eyes on the road!

04:10.940 --> 04:11.780
Sir!

04:12.400 --> 04:13.859
Keep your pace up...

04:13.860 --> 04:15.399
Stay at top speed!

04:15.400 --> 04:16.240
But, sir...

04:17.060 --> 04:18.189
Why?!

04:18.190 --> 04:21.790
If Squad Levi doesn't defeat it, who will?

04:26.120 --> 04:27.460
Another one's dead...

04:28.220 --> 04:30.460
And maybe we could've saved him!

04:34.170 --> 04:35.879
One's still fighting...

04:35.880 --> 04:37.220
We could still make it!

04:37.430 --> 04:39.550
Eren, eyes back on the road! Keep going!

04:39.930 --> 04:42.639
Are you telling me to look away?

04:42.640 --> 04:45.599
To abandon my comrades and run?!

04:45.600 --> 04:47.099
Yes, that's right!

04:47.100 --> 04:48.810
Obey the Captain's orders!

04:49.080 --> 04:51.150
I don't understand why
we're leaving them to die!

04:51.510 --> 04:53.959
Or why he won't explain!

04:53.960 --> 04:54.820
Why?!

04:55.190 --> 04:58.239
That's because the Captain decided
the reason should not be explained.

04:58.240 --> 05:01.200
You just don't understand
because you're still green!

05:02.260 --> 05:04.060
If you get it, then shut up and obey!

05:09.140 --> 05:10.080
No...

05:12.670 --> 05:15.300
I can fight on my own.

05:18.590 --> 05:21.430
Why am I relying on others?

05:22.050 --> 05:24.100
I can just fight on my own.

05:28.060 --> 05:29.390
What are you doing, Eren?

05:30.770 --> 05:34.439
You're only allowed to do that
if your life is in danger.

05:34.440 --> 05:36.110
You promised us!

05:39.700 --> 05:40.320
Eren!

05:41.710 --> 05:43.450
You aren't wrong.

05:45.830 --> 05:47.620
If you want to, do it.

05:50.470 --> 05:51.860
I can tell.

05:52.250 --> 05:54.880
He's a real monster.

05:55.130 --> 05:57.710
And it has nothing to do
with his Titan power.

05:58.590 --> 06:01.149
No matter what power you
use to suppress him,

06:01.150 --> 06:03.430
no matter what cage you put him in,

06:03.760 --> 06:07.800
he will never submit to anyone.

06:09.000 --> 06:11.140
I just want
to slaughter the Titans.

06:12.230 --> 06:18.020
Eren, the difference between your
decision and ours is experience.

06:18.610 --> 06:21.780
But you don't have to rely on that.

06:22.920 --> 06:24.120
Choose.

06:24.870 --> 06:26.660
Believe in yourself.

06:27.170 --> 06:30.500
Or believe in the Survey Corps and me.

06:33.150 --> 06:34.959
I don't know...

06:34.960 --> 06:36.490
I never have.

06:36.960 --> 06:38.840
I can believe in my own abilities

06:39.260 --> 06:41.680
or the choices of companions I trust.

06:42.800 --> 06:45.180
But no one ever knows how it will turn out.

06:45.760 --> 06:51.890
So choose for yourself whichever
decision you'll regret least.

07:09.540 --> 07:10.450
Eren!

07:12.750 --> 07:13.870
Have faith!

07:21.470 --> 07:24.540
I came up with a way
that'd only half-kill you.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.600
Sir?

07:28.220 --> 07:32.590
I said I'd only be able to stop
you as a Titan if I killed you.

07:33.640 --> 07:36.479
But this method would only badly wound you.

07:36.480 --> 07:39.520
Of course, it relies on the squad's skill.

07:40.400 --> 07:44.720
The idea is to cut you right
out of the Titan's neck.

07:45.380 --> 07:49.110
We'd end up cutting the ends
of your arms and legs off,

07:49.580 --> 07:52.679
but they'd just grow
back like a lizard's...

07:52.680 --> 07:53.950
Creepy, really.

07:54.540 --> 07:55.710
Wait.

07:56.540 --> 07:59.289
I don't know how they grow back.

07:59.290 --> 08:00.920
Is there some other way...

08:03.130 --> 08:07.600
So you're saying you don't want there
to be any danger or sacrifice?

08:07.930 --> 08:09.300
N-No...

08:09.580 --> 08:11.140
Then just resolve yourself.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.980
We will, too...

08:13.520 --> 08:15.550
The danger for us is
that you might kill us.

08:15.990 --> 08:17.600
So don't worry.

08:18.130 --> 08:20.859
Yes... Understood.

08:20.860 --> 08:23.820
Th-Then, I can do experiments?

08:24.260 --> 08:26.199
It's very risky.

08:26.200 --> 08:30.240
But that doesn't mean that we
can't use him to investigate.

08:30.740 --> 08:33.120
I can be in charge of planning this, right?

08:34.400 --> 08:37.319
Eren, if there's something
you don't understand,

08:37.320 --> 08:38.540
learn to understand it.

08:39.240 --> 08:43.580
It's well worth any risk to our lives.

08:46.860 --> 08:48.920
Ready, Eren?

08:50.400 --> 08:53.640
When it's prepared, I'll use the
smoke round to notify you.

08:53.960 --> 08:56.310
After that, any decisions are up to you.

08:57.070 --> 08:58.400
Roger!

08:59.890 --> 09:05.089
This dried-up well could hold
even a mindless Titan...

09:05.090 --> 09:06.190
Probably!

09:08.740 --> 09:09.960
That's the signal.

09:11.450 --> 09:15.100
Since I sealed the wall, I haven't
tried to control the Titan.

09:16.030 --> 09:22.320
If I lose control, Squad Levi
might kill me this time...

09:31.490 --> 09:33.840
Did he not see the signal?

09:34.280 --> 09:35.180
No...

09:36.120 --> 09:39.450
His ability just isn't that reliable.

09:42.140 --> 09:45.190
Hey, Eren! We're calling it quits for now.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.950
Did something happen?

09:54.140 --> 09:55.620
Hanji...

09:56.980 --> 09:58.840
I can't become a Titan.

10:05.340 --> 10:08.380
So your self-inflicted bite wounds on
your hands aren't healing, either?

10:10.630 --> 10:11.600
No.

10:12.300 --> 10:15.039
If you can't transform into a Titan,

10:15.040 --> 10:18.620
our main goal of sealing
Wall Maria is off the table.

10:20.030 --> 10:21.689
This is an order...

10:21.690 --> 10:23.310
Make it happen.

10:24.880 --> 10:25.950
Yes, sir.

10:27.510 --> 10:29.940
Don't let it get you down, Eren.

10:30.600 --> 10:31.969
But...

10:31.970 --> 10:35.870
Well, it just means you're
more human than I thought.

10:37.870 --> 10:41.110
Better than rushing into
something and getting killed.

10:41.560 --> 10:43.000
This isn't meaningless.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.519
Yeah...

10:44.520 --> 10:47.050
We can't be too careful.

10:49.520 --> 10:52.860
Why is everyone so calm?

10:54.190 --> 10:56.840
Are they okay with my being
unable to turn into a Titan?

11:06.790 --> 11:07.879
Are you okay?

11:07.880 --> 11:08.970
Yes...

11:22.320 --> 11:23.270
Hey...

11:23.270 --> 11:24.110
What's that?

11:25.030 --> 11:26.420
What was that explosion?

11:38.260 --> 11:39.789
Why now?!

11:39.790 --> 11:40.680
Calm down.

11:41.120 --> 11:42.480
Captain Levi!

11:43.070 --> 11:44.110
This is...

11:45.820 --> 11:47.730
I said to calm down.

11:48.180 --> 11:49.966
All of you.

12:16.760 --> 12:18.640
What? What was that sound?

12:32.990 --> 12:33.990
Eren...

12:34.490 --> 12:35.780
What's the meaning of this?!

12:36.620 --> 12:37.280
Sir?

12:37.740 --> 12:39.609
Why now? Without permission?

12:39.610 --> 12:40.330
Answer me!

12:40.460 --> 12:41.330
Eldo, wait.

12:41.331 --> 12:42.569
Answer him, Eren!

12:42.570 --> 12:43.540
What are you thinking?

12:44.650 --> 12:47.080
No, that can wait...

12:47.480 --> 12:52.090
Prove you're not our
enemy, humanity's enemy!

12:53.130 --> 12:54.899
Prove it! Now!

12:54.900 --> 12:56.629
That is your responsibility!

12:56.630 --> 12:59.159
I dare you to make a
single move with that arm!

12:59.160 --> 13:00.930
I'll cut off your head!

13:01.470 --> 13:03.399
I can do it... I'm serious!

13:03.400 --> 13:04.429
Want to try me?

13:04.430 --> 13:05.370
Oluo,

13:05.371 --> 13:06.559
I said to calm down.

13:06.560 --> 13:09.049
Captain, get away from Eren!

13:09.050 --> 13:09.650
You're too close!

13:09.651 --> 13:12.579
No, you're the ones who should get back.

13:12.580 --> 13:13.110
Get back.

13:13.110 --> 13:13.900
Why?!

13:13.901 --> 13:14.939
My intuition.

13:14.940 --> 13:15.989
What's wrong, Eren?

13:15.990 --> 13:17.219
Say something!

13:17.220 --> 13:17.690
Like I said...

13:17.691 --> 13:18.819
No sudden movements!

13:18.820 --> 13:20.489
Prove it to me, Eren!

13:20.490 --> 13:21.420
I said I don't understand.

13:21.421 --> 13:24.129
Answer us! You think we can't kill you?

13:24.130 --> 13:25.299
I'm serious!

13:25.300 --> 13:26.130
Do it now!

13:26.131 --> 13:27.199
Are you even listening?

13:27.200 --> 13:28.170
Okay, let's do this!

13:28.170 --> 13:29.100
Are you humanity's...

13:29.101 --> 13:31.540
Please shut up for a second!

13:37.590 --> 13:40.010
Eren!

13:40.420 --> 13:43.390
Can I touch that arm?!

13:43.890 --> 13:46.479
It's okay, right? Right?

13:46.480 --> 13:47.939
Just let me touch it!

13:47.940 --> 13:49.189
Hanji...

13:49.190 --> 13:50.430
Wait a second!

13:52.440 --> 13:55.069
It's... hot!

13:55.070 --> 13:57.959
Without the skin, it's really damned hot!

13:57.960 --> 13:59.869
Unbelievably hot!

13:59.870 --> 14:00.700
Squad Leader,

14:01.160 --> 14:02.989
you're too reckless!

14:02.990 --> 14:05.699
Hey, don't you feel it's hot, Eren?

14:05.700 --> 14:08.779
How does it feel where
the right hand connects?

14:08.780 --> 14:10.649
I really want to see!

14:10.650 --> 14:11.709
That's right...

14:11.710 --> 14:14.520
If I just pull out this hand...

14:15.460 --> 14:16.510
Stupid thing!

14:19.820 --> 14:21.039
Hey, Eren...

14:21.040 --> 14:22.220
Don't do anything rash!

14:27.100 --> 14:28.299
What?!

14:28.300 --> 14:30.480
Wait, Eren... That was too fast!

14:30.830 --> 14:32.940
I still wanted to
investigate some things...

14:45.090 --> 14:46.200
Captain...

14:47.620 --> 14:49.450
How do you feel?

14:55.330 --> 14:59.920
Not... Not so good...

15:06.510 --> 15:10.860
Until I saw that they were actually ready
to kill me, I didn't understand...

15:11.980 --> 15:14.790
That they doubted me so much.

15:15.450 --> 15:16.740
Of course they do.

15:17.140 --> 15:19.400
That's why I chose them.

15:21.150 --> 15:24.149
People say you only truly become a
full member of the Survey Corps

15:24.150 --> 15:26.410
after making it back alive from a mission.

15:27.160 --> 15:30.220
But whenever you fight the Titans,
you never have enough information.

15:31.040 --> 15:34.850
There are too many situations you just
can't anticipate, no matter what.

15:36.360 --> 15:39.299
They've had to cultivate the
ability to take quick action

15:39.300 --> 15:42.120
and to make ruthless decisions by assuming
the worse case scenario.

15:43.130 --> 15:46.550
But that doesn't mean
they've become heartless.

15:47.380 --> 15:51.680
It's not like they felt nothing when
they turned their swords on you.

15:52.950 --> 15:54.120
Captain Levi...

15:55.330 --> 15:57.100
Squad Leader Hanji wants to see you.

16:00.500 --> 16:02.509
Take a long crap?

16:02.510 --> 16:05.570
Actually, it was pleasantly quick.

16:06.000 --> 16:08.630
I wasn't sure what to tell the brass.

16:09.360 --> 16:10.850
Well, for now...

16:11.510 --> 16:12.900
Look at this.

16:14.230 --> 16:16.579
A teaspoon?

16:16.580 --> 16:17.540
Yes.

16:18.380 --> 16:21.819
The right Titan hand Eren
created was holding this.

16:21.820 --> 16:25.800
Like this, between its
index finger and thumb.

16:27.110 --> 16:30.510
It's hard to imagine
that was an accident...

16:30.920 --> 16:32.369
And for some reason,

16:32.370 --> 16:35.440
the heat and pressure didn't
warp the spoon at all.

16:35.610 --> 16:37.310
Anything come to mind?

16:38.830 --> 16:40.860
I was trying to pick it up...

16:41.530 --> 16:43.570
I transformed right after.

16:44.760 --> 16:46.150
I see...

16:46.960 --> 16:50.910
That may explain why you
couldn't transform earlier.

16:52.730 --> 16:54.170
"Kill the Titans."

16:54.470 --> 16:55.710
"Block the cannon shell."

16:56.080 --> 16:57.790
"Lift the boulder."

16:58.320 --> 17:03.030
In each case, you had a clear
goal before you transformed.

17:04.170 --> 17:05.369
My theory is

17:05.370 --> 17:08.520
that your self-inflicted injury
probably isn't the sole trigger.

17:08.920 --> 17:12.100
You may need some goal, as well.

17:13.170 --> 17:15.399
It's true that when I turned
into a Titan this time,

17:15.400 --> 17:18.190
it was like when I blocked
that cannon shell.

17:18.530 --> 17:19.650
But...

17:20.200 --> 17:23.240
I turned into a Titan to pick up a spoon?

17:24.600 --> 17:26.540
What the hell is this?

17:28.460 --> 17:33.040
In other words, you didn't deliberately
change without permission?

17:33.710 --> 17:34.560
No, sir.

17:49.540 --> 17:51.550
Huh? Eh?

17:51.870 --> 17:54.010
Wait, what are you doing?

17:54.660 --> 17:56.090
That hurt...

17:56.970 --> 17:58.740
This isn't easy.

17:59.110 --> 18:02.590
I'm amazed you can bite through, Eren.

18:03.070 --> 18:05.280
We made the wrong decision.

18:05.980 --> 18:07.810
This is a small price to pay.

18:08.160 --> 18:10.530
Not that it makes a difference.

18:11.870 --> 18:14.440
Keeping you under control is our job.

18:14.940 --> 18:17.100
And there's nothing wrong with that.

18:17.530 --> 18:19.330
So don't get cocky!

18:19.730 --> 18:21.290
I'm sorry, Eren...

18:21.980 --> 18:23.840
We've been so jumpy.

18:24.650 --> 18:26.330
You must be disappointed in our stupidity.

18:27.280 --> 18:29.610
However, even so...

18:30.120 --> 18:34.160
We're going to rely on you.
And we want you to rely on us.

18:39.530 --> 18:40.540
So...

18:41.670 --> 18:44.520
Have faith in us...

18:54.470 --> 18:55.370
Eren!

18:55.880 --> 18:58.040
You're taking too long! Decide!

19:00.870 --> 19:02.330
I'll go forward!

19:09.230 --> 19:10.720
Let me go!

19:16.740 --> 19:18.140
I'm sorry!

19:25.750 --> 19:27.270
Target is accelerating!

19:28.010 --> 19:29.049
Go!

19:29.050 --> 19:30.410
We will outrun it.

19:33.600 --> 19:36.510
It's impossible to outrun it...

19:37.110 --> 19:41.100
If we keep running away,
it'll stomp us all flat!

19:44.370 --> 19:45.330
But...

19:45.830 --> 19:47.590
We might all die,

19:48.030 --> 19:49.840
but everyone chose to go on,

19:50.210 --> 19:52.340
even if it meant abandoning our comrades.

19:53.420 --> 19:56.650
Captain Levi has been looking
forward this whole time.

19:57.620 --> 19:58.900
And the rest of the squad

19:59.400 --> 20:01.850
believe in him, and put
all their trust in him.

20:03.850 --> 20:07.360
I'll believe in them, too...

20:09.090 --> 20:10.360
Like they

20:11.580 --> 20:13.580
believed in me!

20:29.380 --> 20:31.440
Fire!

20:51.830 --> 20:54.369
Advance a bit farther, tether the horses,

20:54.370 --> 20:55.780
and switch to Maneuver Gear.

20:56.290 --> 20:58.320
You guys will be off on
your own for a while.

20:58.710 --> 21:00.430
Eldo, lead the squad.

21:01.940 --> 21:05.179
Once you're a good distance away
from the Titan, hide Eren.

21:05.180 --> 21:06.500
Take my horse.

21:11.600 --> 21:12.670
He can't intend

21:13.840 --> 21:16.950
to take that Titan alive?

21:21.760 --> 21:23.839
Well, Eren? See that?

21:23.840 --> 21:25.980
We caught that Titan!

21:26.270 --> 21:28.439
This is the power of the Survey Corps!

21:28.440 --> 21:30.060
Don't underestimate us, fool.

21:30.370 --> 21:32.080
Well? Do you get it now?

21:33.950 --> 21:34.920
Yes!

21:39.290 --> 21:41.370
Looks like it's stopped moving...

21:41.980 --> 21:43.410
We can't lower our guard.

21:44.100 --> 21:47.640
But you did well, leading it here.

21:48.920 --> 21:53.960
Men in the rearguard squads died
buying us the time we needed.

21:54.760 --> 21:56.760
We couldn't have done it without them.

21:57.530 --> 21:58.550
Is that so?

21:59.050 --> 22:00.060
It is.

22:01.960 --> 22:06.730
Thanks to them, we'll be able
to see who's inside this thing.

22:09.210 --> 22:12.290
I hope they haven't pissed themselves...

23:54.070 --> 24:00.260
Erwin Smith's secret plan was
to capture the Female Titan.

24:01.120 --> 24:05.679
The aces of the Survey Corps try
to reveal its true identity, but...
